  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 22px 42px 26px; background-color: #16161a; background-image: url(\u0026#34;data:image/png;base64,\u0026#34;); background-repeat: repeat-y; background-size: 100% 40px; color: #e5e0d5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #5e503a; display: table; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #e8b45a; font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e35MM // CINEMA\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; text-align: right; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #8e8677\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eREEL 24FPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 13px 15px; background-color: #201f24; border: 1px dashed #8a6e41; border-radius: 4px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #f4ede0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0\"\u003e灯光暗下的那一秒，银幕亮起，文字也跟着进入 24 帧每秒的胶片叙事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding: 9px 12px; background-color: #222026; border-top: 2px solid #e8b45a; border-bottom: 1px dashed #5c503e\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #e8b45a; margin-right: 6px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eSCENE\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #16161a; background-color: #e8b45a; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 10px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e01\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: inline; margin: 0; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.8px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e每一幕开场都有它的光影语法\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #e5e0d5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e左右 35mm 胶片齿孔贯穿整篇长文，\u003cstrong style=\"color: #f3c677; font-weight: 700\"\u003e暗金票根标题与宽银幕画框\u003c/strong\u003e把影评氛围拉满。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 13px 16px; background-color: #1f1d1b; border-left: 3px solid #e8b45a\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #f3d299; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0\"\u003e好电影在散场之后，才真正开始在记忆里放映。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 10px 8px; background-color: #0b0b0e; border: 1px solid #4f4638\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/midnight-cinema.jpg\" alt=\"午夜雨街与复古影院暖光\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: block; margin-top: 6px; text-align: right; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#